 "notes": [
  "Qty 61 as published: Starships are headed 12 but list 13 (X-wing x2 plus 11 others).",
  "Tagged Dark on DeckTech, but the strategy ends 'OOPS THIS IS A LIGHT SIDE DECK' and every card is Light; filed as Light.",
  "Starting (7): Quiet Mining Colony / Independent Operation, Bespin, Cloud City: North Corridor, Heading For The Medical Frigate (posted 'MEDICLE FRIGATE'), Squadron Assignments, Menace Fades and Battle Plan (posted 'BATTLE PLANS'); several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'ALTAR' dested Alter (meant: the Premiere Light Interrupt; the bare title is the helper's exact title); 'CONTOL' Control (Dagobah Light Interrupt); 'BANKTA TANK' Bacta Tank; 'OBI-ONE WITH STICK' Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'CHEBACCA OF KASHYYK' Chewbacca Of Kashyyyk; 'LSJK' Luke Skywalker, Jedi Knight; 'LS REBEL SCOUT' Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout; 'LEIA WITH GUN' Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'LIETENANT BLOUT' Lieutenant Blount; 'COLONEL CRAKEN' Colonel Cracken; 'LANDO IN FALCON' Lando In Millennium Falcon; 'ARTOO IN RED FIVE' Artoo-Detoo In Red 5.",
  "'RED SQUADREN 4' and 'RED SQUADREN 7' dested the Death Star II Red Squadron 4 and 7; no Red Squadron 10 exists, so 'RED SQUADREN 10' dested Red 10 (Special Edition).",
  "'CLOUD CITY UPPER PLAZA CORRIDOR' dested the Light Cloud City: Upper Plaza Corridor; 'CLOUD CITY PLATFORM 327' Cloud City: Platform 327 (Docking Bay); 'RONDEVOUS POINT' Rendezvous Point."
 ],
